WHAT THIS REPOSITORY DOES NOT CONTAIN

No book text, no model weights, no conversation logs, and no user data. The corpus
pipeline reads files the user already has on their own machine and writes indexes into a
gitignored directory. Nothing derived from a copyrighted source is redistributed here.

`ollie_longest_overlap` (native/ollie_native.cpp, with a Python twin in native/loader.py)
blocks any generated reply that reproduces more than twelve consecutive words from an
imported source.

